{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1530336-how-to-do-crossover-with-hunter","id":1530336,"title":"How to do Crossover with Hunter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-08T19:37:37-08:00","id":1530336,"title":"How to do Crossover with Hunter?","content":"Like outside from my homebrew, I can't think of reason for Hunter from Compact or Conspiracy to cooperate with a crew of monster? How do you get Hunter to coperate with the Monster outside of Contagion Chronicle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T20:24:15-08:00","id":1530338,"title":"","content":"Aligned or unaligned interests. Hunters and monsters are individuals, and hunter groups are likewise not monolithic representations of the archetypal Hunter Of Monsters.<br /> <br /> Some groups have more diplomatic interests; the Ascending Ones explicitly so, but the Long Night's ideas about cures and redemption might be palatable to more reluctant monsters on paper (before it goes sideways), and hunters still capable of trust can generally make their peace with a monster once they've established it isn't a threat.<br /> <br /> Some groups have a focus that not every monster fits into and some monsters won't provide them with an excuse to try and pigeonhole into that focus; the Malleus Maleficarum hunts vampires, witches, and demons, the Aegis Kai Doru hunts shapeshifters and witches, the Council of Bones has their beef with necromantic powers not their own, and while those are broad enough to fit a lot of stuff into, a dedicated compact of vampire hunters has a slight incentive against dipping their toes into playing The Most Dangerous Game with a werewolf pack.<br /> <br /> Sometimes circumstance acquaints a group with strange bedfellows \u2014 the fine folks at Campion Wildlife Services probably aren't going to complain too loudly about a vengeful cyborg also working to track down whatever wannabe mad biologist has been spawning frog-wolf hybrids in the swamp and causing a great deal of mischief, even if the culmination of that pursuit gets very complicated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-09T03:06:29-08:00","id":1530356,"title":"","content":"From what I read of Hunter so far a lot of compact and conspiracy don't seem to be very pragmatic in their view of the supernatural, can you give me some example of what kind of circumstance that would make a Hunter Compact and Conspiracy work with Monster, that isn't the Contagion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-09T04:13:21-08:00","id":1530360,"title":"","content":"Any severe enough threat would get Hunters to fight along side the splats. A rank 6+ spirit or idigam manifesting into the physical world. Or if the Beshilu weaken the gauntlet enough in a major metropolitan area that spirits start possessing / claiming en masse. <br /> <br /> But also remember, Hunters are people first. If a Hunter discovered their dead brother came back as one of the Bound and is working to stop a Reaper from harvesting living people to feed the underworld then that particular hunter may work beside his brother. <br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-09T09:33:50-08:00","id":1530386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1530336-how-to-do-crossover-with-hunter?p=1530356#post1530356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I read of Hunter so far a lot of compact and conspiracy don't seem to be very pragmatic in their view of the supernatural, can you give me some example of what kind of circumstance that would make a Hunter Compact and Conspiracy work with Monster, that isn't the Contagion?</div> </div> </div> </div>What gives you the impression Hunters are not pragmatic? Like that's very un hunter like","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-09T09:45:37-08:00","id":1530387,"title":"","content":"Basically, what we\u2019re getting at is that a <i>lot</i> of variables are involved with this in-universe. In a more meta sense, though, you don\u2019t actually have to include every single conspiracy or compact if most of them don\u2019t fit with the other splats you\u2019re using. You wouldn\u2019t include the Malleus Maleficarum in a Chronicle that doesn\u2019t have what could justifiably be considered viable substitutes to \u2018standard\u2019 Vampires, Mages/witches (that is, varied magic users) or demons (Unchained or otherwise), now would you?<br /> <br /> But still, non-Contagion situations that could make a Hunter Compact or Conspiracy work alongside supernatural entities? Well, if you\u2019re willing to read examples involving fan-splats\u2026<ul><li>Aiding a Clique/Nakama of Nobles with an outbreak of Darkspawn, or just counteracting the machinations of a Twilight or <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H5UIzA0YDeoAdf6fc0ugBMqpFuQtK0lXsHuu4L1Egn4/mobilebasic\" target=\"_blank\">Midnight</a> Court.</li> <li>Helping a Collaboration of Genii contain the escaped result of some Inspired\u2019s poorly thought-out experiment.</li> <li>Wiping out the local population of Pandorans alongside a Throng of Prometheans.</li> <li>Stopping the killing spree of one or more Insatiable at the request of a Brood of Begotten needing allies.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-07T18:14:30-07:00","id":1533779,"title":"","content":"Deviant crosses over very well with Hunter. Have the Hunters be Tier 3 and the Deviants play as Devoted of the same conspiracy, and you're basically playing Hellboy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28446-troscus","name":"Troscus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-08T20:18:11-07:00","id":1533869,"title":"","content":"Hunters aren't necessarily on a crusade against everything even a little bit supernatural.<br /> <br /> 1. Maybe the hunters don't know that their friends are monsters.<br /> 2. Maybe the hunters know their friends aren't &quot;normal&quot; but don't think they count as monsters (mages, deviants, sin-eaters, maybe changelings)<br /> 3. Maybe the hunters would happily destroy their monstrous allies but need their help against a worse threat (The typical Dresden Files situation)<br /> 4. Maybe the hunters and the monsters are working together because they're both trying to play each other off against other enemies.<br /> 5. Maybe the hunters are territorial and are willing to ally with anyone that doesn't cause problems in their territory.<br /> 6. Or, maybe the hunters belong to a conspiracy with a particular mission and is willing to ally with monsters with a similar goal (VALKYRIE tries to defend the US and its interests, AKD wants relics, Ascending Ones actually try to be supernatural peacemakers and diplomats, VASCU hunts monsters within a law enforcement context and need things like warrants, White Rabbit Society just wants to explore otherworlds, etc)<br /> 7. Maybe the hunters are just hunting a particular monster that hurt them personally and are willing to accept help from scary people they don't have a grudge against.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11959-niknokk","name":"Niknokk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-20T03:30:11-07:00","id":1538937,"title":"","content":"Crimson Halo might intervene on behalf of a Changeling just out of the Hedge as readily as they'd intervene on behalf of a runaway just off the bus. And they might not stop just because they find out this particular &quot;chicken&quot; is supernatural.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}